      "text": "LAREDO - 32 ft long"
    },
    {
      "id": "7c1cc71",
      "container": "fb6ccbc",
      "type": "text-editor",
      "html": "<p>The LAREDO is a spacious 32-ft RV rental designed for comfort and convenience, sleeping up to 6 guests—perfect for families or small groups. Enjoy a relaxing stay with water, sewer, cable, and high-speed internet all included, along with full access to community amenities. Rates are $150 per night (3-night minimum), $1,000 weekly, or $1,800 monthly, making it a great option for both short getaways and extended stays. Please note, no pets are allowed.</p>"
    },
